            <note corresp="#d1006-f3" n="51" xml:id="d1006-f3-content">
                <p>Approval by the Department of State of the proposed solution was indicated in its
                    telegram 90, February 24, 7 p.m., to Panamá (819.00/2–2445).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
